  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to watch a product video within the image gallery on the PDP,\n\n**so that** I can see the product in motion before deciding to buy.\n\n----\n\nA product may have one or more videos (e.g. studio, campaign, runway) appearing as tiles within the image gallery, sourced from Vimeo. Video assignment and ordering is managed by merchandisers in BM (SFCC-302). Gallery rendering is as specified in the pdp/carousel component (SFCC-731).",
